<body>
    <h1>[Q3] Updated MCP Scan Profile</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"0=
295b53b5c6e" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 53.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 177.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 370.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 115.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 180.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 180.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 180.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 180.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 180.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 180.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d01f502dc8eb">
<th data-local-id=3D"c60c439f6cf0" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"80e87a787cd7"><strong>No.</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"e912444548f6" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"c6886d7190a6"><strong>Rule Names</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"4197268023b9" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"cf2106a46584"><strong>Description (What It Detects)</strong>=
</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"5c4dc904db70" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"24889323835b"><strong>Default Action on Detection</strong></=
p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"a0531a0e4d02" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"97be162936e0"><strong>Typical Severity</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"9df13d49219c" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"5b5d3f6ba419"><strong>Taxonomy Mapping</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"1cf4e03d0c17" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"d2a220836ba0"><strong>Config</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"c41dce64132d" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"0dd27ba41d2a"><strong>MCP Scanner Support</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"1653204b72a3" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"4874cac8763d"><strong>Supported Capabilities</strong></p></t=
h>
<th data-local-id=3D"e72b9ba5180b" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ac6506d955d0"><strong>Not Supported Capabilities</strong></p=
></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c115cd023920">
<td data-local-id=3D"29e610828ca0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0af0d9889681">1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"00556d4dd312" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"29a25a0c6df2">Malicious Code Execution</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9121b45aafa9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0aa662c920dc">Detects harmful code payloads in MCP tools: ba=
ckdoors, trojans, arbitrary code execution (eval/exec/compile), injection a=
ttacks (SQL, command, XSS), and template injection (SSTI). Scans both tool =
metadata and MCP server implementation code. Rule also covers tool poisonin=
g, where malicious code payloads are embedded in tools.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4e061e8f7971" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3f1e157e77cb">Block / Quarantine + Alert</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2bc60418fcf0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f1c5769b0d94">AISubtech-9.2.2: HIGH, AISubtech-9.1.1: LOW, A=
ISubtech-9.1.4: HIGH, AISubtech-9.1.5: MEDIUM</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"59dbda1e58db" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c0be0cd963a8">AISubtech-9.2.2 (Backdoors and Trojans), AISub=
tech-9.1.1 (Code Execution), AISubtech-9.1.4 (Injection Attacks (e.g., SQL,=
 Command Execution, XSS)), AISubtech-9.1.5 (Template Injection (e.g., SSTI)=
)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2e5b704916d5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"956ca28d0a78">Enable or Disable</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2d7c610fbef8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"931f0bc4dc56">YES</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8bd9d4a941b3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d7b89333a456">Detects malicious code patterns in tool metada=
ta (YARA, LLM) and in MCP server source code (Behavioral Code Analyzer - AS=
T parsing, cross-file dataflow, alignment checking).</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e2fc1c3f7d6e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"39d086679317"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"89540420c59c">
<td data-local-id=3D"a65d97dae77d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d7ff0dec3282">2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4b5c9a5f9c36" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"41fb28eb2caf">Prompt Injection and Jailbreak Attempts</p></t=
d>
<td data-local-id=3D"b48aeadc7cf8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fccad99b1c1d">Detects hidden instructions, DAN-style prompts=
, and obfuscated attacks in MCP artifacts intended to override or manipulat=
e the LLM. Rule includes instruction manipulation via tool descriptions, pr=
ompts, resources, and server instructions, as well as tool poisoning via me=
tadata where the goal is to inject instructions that manipulate the LLM's r=
easoning.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d4fd3f6748c8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e9c7e80c600c">Block</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0f480a4f0c77" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"865d86d5a08a">AISubtech-1.1.1: HIGH, AISubtech-12.1.2: HIGH<=
/p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fe08bf04367c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e31b4320c1f9">AISubtech-1.1.1 (Instruction Manipulation (Dir=
ect Prompt Injection)), AISubtech-12.1.2 (Tool Poisoning)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"de96790de1b1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a99514e27255">Enable or Disable</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9054914cb9a1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"44376d972799">YES</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2bc744e2af28" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6e4cab162951">Detects injection patterns in tool metadata (Y=
ARA, LLM, AI Defense API) and poisoned tool registrations in MCP server sou=
rce code (Behavioral Code Analyzer).</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"44ccf26b9c7a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"da19ca016925"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1df44c85b0b4">
<td data-local-id=3D"82b4a8960fe2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b1ab9cace8a7">3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7f3c5c4054c6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f9e80825da1f">Unauthorized Network Access</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a1ed44aa8348" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1cbc98dc1764">Detects outbound calls to suspicious endpoints=
, DNS tunneling, command-and-control (C2) patterns, and SSRF in MCP tools o=
r server code. Scans both tool metadata and MCP server implementation code =
for unauthorized network activity unrelated to the tool's declared function=
.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"08c698d8b939" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"28ec936c80f7">Block</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bba0a4abcd24" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"74eb8a91fe0e">HIGH</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a27c978ea6c4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3f05e8221c02">AISubtech-9.1.3 (Unauthorized or Unsolicited N=
etwork Access)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e3a8d91f0c41" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cdf6ffc92a28">Enable or Disable</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2931b0656b81" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a90d29c50be3">YES</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"55023eddaecd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5140ae925632">Detects network patterns in tool metadata (YAR=
A, LLM) and unauthorized outbound connections in MCP server source code (Be=
havioral Code Analyzer - AST detection of requests, urllib, socket, httpx c=
alls).</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ee495d1cd191" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dfea147f351c">Cannot distinguish between customer-approved a=
nd unapproved domains/IPs (requires customer-provided allow-lists).</p></td=
>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"262582a84f2c">
<td data-local-id=3D"e985a1d1a4a9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c63afd7bc72a">4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1881a2158969" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f903403149d0">Resource Abuse and Denial-of-Service</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e92aab588057" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"64fec03fd22c">Detects infinite loops, memory bombs, fork bom=
bs, and excessive resource consumption that could exhaust compute. Scans bo=
th tool metadata and MCP server implementation code for unbounded operation=
s.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fd5818de4c93" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fc06d29e65c4">Block or Rate-limit</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"80f19599a984" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"73e87b2bf042">MEDIUM</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e32f657c9e8d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fc13ac7e8708">AISubtech-13.1.1 (Compute Exhaustion)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5ab20d029792" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8f4dbb043153">Enable or Disable</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ad5d516ba5b6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5a5261da188b">YES</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0784d04da287" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"83f0921f13f6">Detects DoS patterns in tool metadata (YARA, L=
LM) and unbounded loops, missing break conditions, and recursive calls with=
out depth limits in MCP server source code (Behavioral Code Analyzer).</p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"911f10395263" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"080bd6d0d3c6"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3459484de268">
<td data-local-id=3D"702cf25dad50" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e48122b06fb6">5</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"83efa34e779c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4b8fc32f2ce8">Defense Evasion</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e34ef9053780" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0eadac426e07">Detects techniques to bypass sandbox or isolat=
ion boundaries: ctypes imports, os.execv, container escapes (nsenter, /proc=
 manipulation), and system-level interactions beyond allowed scope. Primari=
ly detected in MCP server implementation code.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"02b522559919" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a525c5b83237">Block/Alert</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fa67e925a8b3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"779f4e546cc2">HIGH</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2e913fe08be9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b3be1b9393ce">AISubtech-11.1.2 (Tool-Scoped Evasion)</p></td=
>
<td data-local-id=3D"7785c389d1ec" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6489159853cd">Enable or Disable</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5a2b322ef51c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9a1bb4ac0c77">YES</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c9c7dc2c6631" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8ea94eff43d6">Detects evasion behavior in tool metadata (LLM=
 semantic analysis) and sandbox/container escape techniques in MCP server s=
ource code (Behavioral Code Analyzer - AST analysis of imports and system c=
alls).</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3f31cc86baf6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e17fe1c540b0"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f0900a450002">
<td data-local-id=3D"37bd7f138ee4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e312a829861d">6</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b9a7c38f559f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"44bbb6931b7a">Unauthorized File System Access</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9ef444d32f73" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bcc919241fbe">Detects unauthorized file reads/writes, path t=
raversal attacks, and access to sensitive system files (credentials, SSH ke=
ys, environment files). Scans both tool metadata and MCP server implementat=
ion code.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"928652275535" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d1d47e996035">Block</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"eb6315219b42" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"84ae32ef4ea7">HIGH</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"222fdce09c67" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cbea97abff9f">AISubtech-9.1.2 (Unauthorized or Unsolicited S=
ystem Access), AISubtech-12.1.3 (Unsafe System / Browser / File Exec)</p></=
td>
<td data-local-id=3D"45ab2fb8b0d5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b473baea1d68">Enable or Disable</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"17fc809f0f1d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9e3fe426e75c">PARTIAL</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3339048fc4f8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"76192b448511">Detects file access patterns in tool metadata =
(YARA, LLM) and unauthorized file operations, path traversal, and sensitive=
 path access in MCP server source code (Behavioral Code Analyzer).</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d7404513704e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2ab8d6ec8a27">Cannot enforce customer-defined allow/deny pat=
h policies (e.g., "only /workspace is permitted").</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"308a0a6d3381">
<td data-local-id=3D"17098e76b7bc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"94bc08ea931e">7</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a130e8261906" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f5364737cfef">Data Exfiltration via Tools</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"afb6d2306b4d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2e35cf5d4903">Detects unauthorized extraction or leakage of =
sensitive information: outbound data transmission, covert exfiltration chan=
nels (DNS tunneling, encoded URLs), and credential harvesting. Scans both t=
ool metadata and MCP server implementation code.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b1ea2026cdf9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a0fba87cb5f1">Block</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a9adc5eaf48a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0199df440b77">HIGH</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0006315d5a36" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"37285a05a89e">AISubtech-8.2.3 (Data Exfiltration via Agent T=
ooling)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a8a3f6777393" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cb500eaa2197">Enable or Disable</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"741f016acdc8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3fc5adb3ddde">PARTIAL</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b6ae4a41a0e0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d4c3df1d395b">Detects exfiltration patterns in tool metadata=
